      "en": "Have mercy on us, LORD, have mercy on us, for we have endured much contempt.",
      "ko": "여호와여 우리를 긍휼히 여기시고 긍휼히 여기소서 심한 멸시가 우리에게 넘치나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "18c3803f1d14ff8964419ccd0e967eb767c5fa269b726d619714f953120ef4e3",
      "translation_text_hash": "607bfe51a984d4baadd63d8626c8335cf39e1450e45f1422c16bfe847d4bbd05",
